<style>
#form-ID-container {
	container-type: inline-size;
}
#form-ID {
	grid-template-areas:
		'type'
		'id'
		'description'
		'category'
		'updated'
		'formgrid'
		'required'
		'index'
		'inheritFrom'
		'properties';
	grid-template-columns: 1fr;
}
@container (min-width: 500px) {
	#form-ID {
		grid-template-areas:
			'type'
			'id'
			'description'
			'category'
			'updated'
			'formgrid'
			'required'
			'index'
			'inheritFrom'
			'properties';
		grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
	}
}
</style><div id="form-ID-container"><form id="form-ID" class="totalform  edit-mode formgrid" data-form="schema" data-schema="schema" data-method="PUT" data-api="/api" data-route="/schemas/widgets" data-id="widgets"><div class="form-field hidden-field " data-type="hidden" style="--grid-area: $id;"><div class="form-group"><input type="hidden" id="field-UID" name="$id" value="https://www.totalcms.co/schemas/custom/widgets.json" autocomplete="nofill"/></div></div><div class="form-field hidden-field " data-type="hidden" style="--grid-area: $schema;"><div class="form-group"><input type="hidden" id="field-UID" name="$schema" value="https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema" autocomplete="nofill"/></div></div><div class="form-field hidden-field " data-type="hidden" style="--grid-area: type;"><div class="form-group"><input type="hidden" id="field-UID" name="type" value="object" autocomplete="nofill"/></div></div><div class="form-field id-field " data-type="id" style="--grid-area: id;"><label for="field-UID">ID</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="id" required readonly placeholder="myschema" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="widgets" autocomplete="off" data-1p-ignore data-lpignore="true" autocapitalize="off"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The unique identifier for this schema.</p></div><div class="form-field textarea-field " data-type="textarea" style="--grid-area: description;" data-settings="{&quot;rows&quot;:2}"><label for="field-UID">Description</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="description" rows="2" placeholder="About your schema." autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID"></textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">A decription of the schema.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: category;" data-settings="{&quot;propertyOptions&quot;:&quot;schemas&quot;}"><label for="field-UID">Category</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="category" aria-describedby="help-UID" list="datalist-UID" autocomplete="nofill"/><datalist id="datalist-UID"><option value="Internal">Internal</option></datalist><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Add a category to organize the schemas in the side panel</p></div><div class="form-field datetime-field " data-type="datetime" style="--grid-area: updated;" data-settings="{&quot;onUpdate&quot;:true,&quot;readonly&quot;:true}"><label for="field-UID">Updated Date</label><div class="form-group"><input type="datetime-local" id="field-UID" name="updated" readonly aria-describedby="help-UID" value="NOW" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Last saved date. Maintained automatically; preserved verbatim when a schema arrives via sync.</p></div><div class="form-field textarea-field " data-type="textarea" style="--grid-area: formgrid;" data-settings="{&quot;rows&quot;:5}"><label for="field-UID">Form Grid Layout</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="formgrid" rows="5" placeholder="id id id
field field field" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID"></textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">A text based grid layout for the form. This is used to create a grid layout for the form fields.</p></div><div class="form-field list-field " data-type="list" style="--grid-area: required;" data-settings="{&quot;addChoices&quot;:false}"><label for="field-UID">Required Properties</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="required" multiple size="1" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="id" selected>id</option><option value="title">title</option><option value="mycard">mycard</option><option value="mydeck">mydeck</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">A list of required properties.</p></div><div class="form-field list-field " data-type="list" style="--grid-area: index;" data-settings="{&quot;addChoices&quot;:false}"><label for="field-UID">Indexed Properties</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="index" multiple size="1" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="id" selected>id</option><option value="title" selected>title</option><option value="mycard">mycard</option><option value="mydeck">mydeck</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">A list of properties to index. These will be accessible in a Collection's Index.</p></div><div class="form-field list-field " data-type="list" style="--grid-area: inheritFrom;" data-settings="{&quot;addChoices&quot;:false}"><label for="field-UID">Inherit From Schemas</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="inheritFrom" multiple size="1" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="auth">auth</option><option value="automation-trigger">automation-trigger</option><option value="automations">automations</option><option value="blog-legacy">blog-legacy</option><option value="blog">blog</option><option value="code">code</option><option value="color">color</option><option value="date">date</option><option value="dataviews">dataviews</option><option value="depot">depot</option><option value="email">email</option><option value="feed">feed</option><option value="file">file</option><option value="gallery">gallery</option><option value="image">image</option><option value="mailer">mailer</option><option value="mcp-collection">mcp-collection</option><option value="mcp-prompt">mcp-prompt</option><option value="mcp-prompt-arg">mcp-prompt-arg</option><option value="mcp-property">mcp-property</option><option value="mcp-tool">mcp-tool</option><option value="number">number</option><option value="builder-page">builder-page</option><option value="playground">playground</option><option value="preset-item">preset-item</option><option value="seo">seo</option><option value="seo-collection">seo-collection</option><option value="seo-site">seo-site</option><option value="sitemap-meta">sitemap-meta</option><option value="styledtext">styledtext</option><option value="svg">svg</option><option value="text">text</option><option value="toggle">toggle</option><option value="totalcms">totalcms</option><option value="totalcms-item">totalcms-item</option><option value="url">url</option><option value="video">video</option><option value="widget-card">widget-card</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Select schemas to inherit properties from. Inherited properties are merged with this schema's properties (this schema's properties take precedence). Only one level of inheritance is supported.</p></div><div class="form-field schemaProperties-field " data-type="schemaProperties" style="--grid-area: properties;"><label for="field-UID">Schema Properties</label><div class="form-group"><input type="hidden" name="properties"/><div class="schema-field id-field slug-type"><input autocomplete="off" type="text" name="property" placeholder="property" required value="id" disabled readonly/><button type="button" class="button btn edit sort-handle" title="Edit id property"></button><button type="button" class="button btn duplicate" title="Duplicate id property"></button><button type="button" class="button btn trash" title="Delete id property"></button><dialog class="cms-modal small"><section class="scroller"><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: field;" data-settings="{&quot;clearValue&quot;:false}"><label for="field-UID">Type of Form Field</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="field" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled>Select a field type</option><optgroup label="Text (String) Fields"><option value="code">code</option><option value="email">email</option><option value="hidden">hidden</option><option value="json">json</option><option value="phone">phone</option><option value="radio">radio</option><option value="secret">secret</option><option value="select">select</option><option value="styledtext">styledtext</option><option value="svg">svg</option><option value="text">text</option><option value="textarea">textarea</option><option value="time">time</option><option value="url">url</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Boolean Fields"><option value="checkbox">checkbox</option><option value="toggle">toggle</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Number Fields"><option value="number">number</option><option value="price">price</option><option value="range">range</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Date Fields"><option value="date">date</option><option value="datetime">datetime</option></optgroup><optgroup label="List (Array) Fields"><option value="checklist">checklist</option><option value="list">list</option><option value="multiselect">multiselect</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Special Fields"><option value="card">card</option><option value="color">color</option><option value="deck">deck</option><option value="deckTable">deckTable</option><option value="depot">depot</option><option value="file">file</option><option value="gallery">gallery</option><option value="id" selected>id</option><option value="image">image</option><option value="password">password</option><option value="video">video</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Localization Fields"><option value="localizedtext">localizedtext</option><option value="localizedtextarea">localizedtextarea</option><option value="localizedstyledtext">localizedstyledtext</option></optgroup></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The type form field that this field will use</p></div><details open class="cms-accordion "><summary>Form Info</summary><div class="content"><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: label;"><label for="field-UID">Label</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="label" placeholder="Enter a label" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The label that will be added to the field form</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: placeholder;"><label for="field-UID">Placeholder</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="placeholder" placeholder="Enter a placeholder" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The placeholder text that will be added to the field form</p></div><div class="form-field textarea-field " data-type="textarea" style="--grid-area: help;"><label for="field-UID">Help</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="help" rows="2" placeholder="Enter help text" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID"></textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The help text that will be added to the field form</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: default;"><label for="field-UID">Default Value</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="default" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The default value for this property when an object is saved without a value</p></div></div></details><details class="cms-accordion "><summary>Settings &amp; Options</summary><div class="content"><div class="form-field json-field " data-type="json" style="--grid-area: settings;"><label for="field-UID">Settings</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="settings" rows="7" placeholder="{ &quot;key&quot;: &quot;value&quot; }" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID"></textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The settings for this field in valid JSON format</p></div><div class="form-field json-field " data-type="json" style="--grid-area: options;"><label for="field-UID">Options &amp; Datalist</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="options" rows="7" placeholder="[ &quot;option1&quot;, &quot;option2&quot;, &quot;option3&quot; ]" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID"></textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The options for select fields and datalists in valid JSON format.</p></div></div></details><details class="cms-accordion "><summary>Property Info</summary><div class="content"><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: type;"><label for="field-UID">Type of Data</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="type" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled>Auto (based on field type)</option><option value="array">array</option><option value="boolean">boolean</option><option value="card">card</option><option value="code">code</option><option value="color">color</option><option value="date">date</option><option value="deck">deck</option><